      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4847792993207919483, guid: b542e34f43602244da5b82f945262781, type: 3}
      propertyPath: text
      value: 'THE COMPASS, TOP LEFT. THE GREEN SPIKE POINTS AT THE DOORWAY OF THIS
        ROOM THAT LEADS TOWARD THE EXIT. AS THE ARCH MAGE YOU ALSO HAVE A RED ONE,
        FOR THE RESURRECTION ROOM. A SPIKE SPINS WHEN YOU ARE ALREADY IN ITS ROOM.
        THE DOORWAYS SAY NOTHING: ONLY THE NUMBER ON THE FLOOR TELLS YOU WHICH ROOM
        YOU ARE IN.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7111973095020096852, guid: b542e34f43602244da5b82f945262781, type: 3}
